			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.351
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1318
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάσμορος,
		ἤμορος</span>.)</div>
